[statement]
A v7 header (no magic) with typeflag `x`. The reference readers apply it as a
pax header, and some Rust readers read it as a regular file, so the readers
disagree on the members. In Strict, ferrotape refuses it; in Compatible, it
applies it, as the reference readers do.

[archive]
header name=v7x typeflag=x magic=v7
records path=evilname
header name=victim
data "hello\n"
end

[verdict]
strict: refused MetadataWithoutMagic at 0
compatible: read

